{"applicability_conditions":"适用于回归分析（regression analysis）中对机器学习模型性能的评价。","identity":{"block_id":"b0036","equation_id":"equation_003","equation_number":"3","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nR M S E = \\sqrt {\\frac {1}{N} \\sum_ {N} (y - \\widehat {y}) ^ {2}}\\tag{3}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.mtcomm.2025.113263"},"latex":"RMSE = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{N}(y-\\widehat{y})^{2}}","purpose":"计算均方根误差（RMSE），作为回归分析中评价机器学习模型预测精度/拟合优度的指标。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"均方根误差（root mean square error），衡量模型预测精度/拟合优度的评价指标","symbol":"RMSE","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"样本/数据点数量（求和个数）","symbol":"N","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"真实值（实测值）","symbol":"y","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"模型预测值","symbol":"\\widehat{y}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["该公式与式(4)的MAPE、式(5)的R²共同用于评价模型性能，从不同角度量化模型的拟合优度与预测精度。"]}